## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical, production-ready supply chain security controls across multi-cloud Kubernetes, focusing on SBOMs, artifact signing, and rapid IR.

## Key Concepts

- SBOMs and risk scoring
- Code signing with Cosign and KMS-backed keys
- CI secrets scanning
- Image-signature enforcement at admission
- 24h IR playbook and rollback

## Code Example

```javascript
// verify artifact signature (pseudo)
const crypto = require('crypto');
function verifySignature(blob, signature, publicKeyPem) {
  const verify = crypto.createVerify('SHA256');
  verify.update(blob);
  verify.end();
  return verify.verify(publicKeyPem, signature);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you rotate and revoke keys in flight without downtime?
- How would you integrate Sigstore or a private CA with this workflow?

## Why This Is Asked
This question tests data governance and cloud IAM proficiency in regulated fintech environments, focusing on data lake isolation and rapid IR.

## Key Concepts
- ABAC with tenant attributes
- Deny-by-default bucket policies
- Data-centric protection (field-level encryption/tokenization)
- Policy drift detection (IAM Access Analyzer, CloudTrail)
- Incident response for data leakage (IR playbook, forensics)

## Code Example
```javascript
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Deny",
      "Action": "*",
      "Resource": "*",
      "Condition": {
        "StringNotEquals": {
          "aws:PrincipalTag/tenant_id": "{tenant_id}"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test the policy in dev/stage? 
- What metrics indicate policy drift has been mitigated?

